<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Task Force Normandy</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;17 JAN 1991&lt;BR&gt;North-Eastern Saudia Arabia / Southern Iraq&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/STRONG&gt; US Army 101st Combat Aviation Brigade&lt;BR&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Scenario Length: &lt;/STRONG&gt;4hrs, 30mins&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;The deadline for Saddam Hussein to withdraw Iraqi troops from Kuwait has expired. A massive, coordinated coalition air campaign is to begin in the early hours of 17 JAN 1991, local time. The Iraqi air defence network includes a string of long ranged early warning radars along the southern border. Destruction of these radar sites is crucial to preventing unacceptable losses to coalition aircraft.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
